put the exact same ACT JOIN_COMMIT coalition. The episode ends at JOIN_COMMIT or after eight Ego steps.\n\nReason briefly inside <reason>...</reason>, then emit exactly one listed action inside <answer>...</answer>.\n\nGenerator: resource_conflict/cannot_help\nEGO goal: {item_F,item_K}\nEGO holdings: {item_K,item_T}\nCommunication: 0/6; Ego steps: 0/8\nKnown partner facts: {'P1': {}, 'P2': {}}\nPartner holdings are hidden until truthfully revealed by ASK HOLDINGS.\n\nLegal actions: ASK P1 GOAL, ASK P1 HOLDINGS, ASK P1 GIVE item_K, ASK P1 GIVE item_F, ASK P1 GIVE item_T, ASK P1 GIVE item_Q, ASK P1 GIVE item_L, ASK P1 GIVE item_Z, ASK P1 GIVE item_V, ASK P1 GIVE item_M, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_K receive=item_K, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_K receive=item_F, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_K receive=item_T, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_K receive=item_Q, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_K receive=item_L, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_K receive=item_Z, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_K receive=item_V, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_K receive=item_M, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_T receive=item_K, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_T receive=item_F, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_T receive=item_T, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_T receive=item_Q, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_T receive=item_L, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_T receive=item_Z, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_T receive=item_V, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_T receive=item_M, ASK P1 JOIN {EGO,P1}, ASK P1 JOIN {EGO,P1,P2}, SAY P1 PROFILE goal={item_F,item_K} holdings={item_K,item_T}, ASK P2 GOAL, ASK P2 HOLDINGS, ASK P2 GIVE item_K, ASK P2 GIVE item_F, ASK P2 GIVE item_T, ASK P2 GIVE item_Q, ASK P2 GIVE item_L, ASK P2 GIVE item_Z, ASK P2 GIVE item_V, ASK P2 GIVE item_M, ASK P2 EXCHANGE give=item_K receive=item_K, ASK P2 EXCHANGE give=item_K receive=item_F, ASK P2 EXCHANGE give=item_K receive=item_T, ASK P2 EXCHANGE give=item_K receive=item_Q, ASK P2 EXCHANGE give=item_K receive=item_L, ASK P2 EXCHANGE give=item_K receive=item_Z, ASK P2 EXCHANGE give=item_K receive=item_V, ASK P2 EXCHA